  "prefLabel": "En 607.01 Records in General",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 607.01 Records in General. All records shall be organized, arranged, or prepared to ensure that sufficient data is available to determine the status of compliance with these rules. Records pertaining to the system design or that are necessary for future evaluation of the system’s safety shall be retained for the life of the facility involved.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
